  (text "ESP32-C3 Super Mini carrier for the BC-250 (serial_led_controller)."
    (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "b6b961e0-151f-4c73-ba0c-c19a97bfa781")
  )
  (text "The Super Mini brings its own USB-C, 3.3 V regulator, BOOT/RESET buttons and GPIO8 LED."
    (at 20.32 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "244314d8-eba7-4aac-812c-b00e940b8253")
  )
  (text "Its USB VBUS is tied to the 5V pin: cut the red wire in the USB cable (README, Power switch)."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "8f7efcc6-3661-41d5-810c-0dc6b7b94a3f")
  )
  (text "The switch common (J9 pin 4) is a real GND: power_switch.pins.button_gnd is null in the config."
    (at 20.32 31.75 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "f83b9c99-d066-4ede-8510-2021cbcdae4b")
  )
  (text "Fan header pin 1 = GND, 2 = +12 V, 3 = tach (unused), 4 = PWM. FAN1..4 = GPIO 5, 6, 7, 10 = fans.header1..4."
    (at 20.32 35.56 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "64e3cd99-bc77-41a8-9533-b9922836a5b2")
  )
  (text "J1 takes the FSP500-30AS 10-pin Mini-Fit Jr plug; pin map per its pinout drawing (see README)."
    (at 20.32 39.37 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
